 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The light is among you a little while longer",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Walk while you have the light",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So that darkness does not overtake you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The one who walks in the darkness",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Does not know where he is going",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "While you have the light",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Believe in the light",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So that you may become",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sons of light",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He said these things and then he went away",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he hid from them",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Though he had done so many signs before them",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They did not believe in him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "While you have the light",
